If the printer is attached to the network via JetDirect, you might be able
to directly address the printer from your Tru64 system.  Have someone in
networks give the printer a CNAME and then address the printer using the
following entries:
lp=@{printer_CNAME}/#9100:\
rm={printer_CNAME}:\
rp=raw:\

You can substitute the appropriate port number (9101-9103) for the #9100
port on multiport JetDirect boxes.

