about to bring down any servers to check :)  Either way, it's probably a good 
bet that this has been answered before.  Do a Usenet search from 
www.dejanews.com against *tru64* groups, and then with *vms* groups.  The 
later because if someone's written some C code to make the change on VMS, it 
