You may need to redirect console output to graphics because Tru64 uses
graphical interface for installation by default. Try checking console variables
with

>>> show console*.

If it directs output to serial then this is exactly your problem.
Try then

>>> set console graphics

or something like this (I don't remember exact syntax but you'll see then).
Good luck.

 Vladimir.





