You edit the disklabel like you are doing here.
Change all the partitions to "unused" and write the label.
Now, re-edit the label, and when you make changes it will not complain.
Be sure to make the c partition the entire-disk-partition, and leave it 
unused.  (Unless you *want* to use a single partition for the entire disk 
-- not possible based on the assumptions I've made about your setup.)


