Hello Zoong,

On Tue, 16 Jan 2001, Zoong Pham wrote:
> How can I know ACL is enable or disable on Tru64 4.0 E and 5.1

If ACLs are enabled you should find in /etc/sysconfigtab:
sec:
        acl_mode = enable

and

/sbin/sysconfig -q sec
must reply the line too, among others.

If not give:

/sbin/sysconfig -r sec acl_mode=enable

See also the Security Manual Cap. 11.3.1 


With best regards
Uwe

