>How can I know ACL is enable or disable on Tru64 4.0 E and 5.1
>In the Security Book I have from Digital Mar 1996, it
>said "See your system administrator to determine if 
>ACLs are enabled on your system."
>But the Sys Admin here doesn't  know either.
>TIA,
>Zoong

under 4.x: the kernel configuration file must include "options DEC_ACL"
under 5.x: /etc/sysconfigdb must contain a stanza:
sec:
        acl_mode = enable

