The problem lies in the fact that this is not a multi-threaded program.
Nothing about it is thread aware. Every thing is executed sequentially.
ie main calls foo which calls bar 100 times, then main calls foo which
calls bar 100 times. In total main calls foo 100 times.

You need to read up some more about thread programming.

Robert Mulley
Unix admin

Standard Disclaimer: I could be completely wrong but I think I'm right.



