Please use a more meaningfull title for your posts.  Lots of people post
wnating help.

long on Tru64 is 64 bit, int is 32 bit, this tends to keep with the
original K&R concept of long and int since Alpha is a 64 bit system
(long is the longest natural integer for the system).

Fix the code so it is declared correctly (#include <stdlib.h> instead of 
defining it yourself), and then used correctly.

