Richard Sites wrote a "Alpha Architecture Reference Manual", which was put 
out by Digital Press.ISBN: 1555582028 This is as close to an ISR as you can 
get.

Also Evens et al "alpha risc architecture for programmers" this is prentice 
hall ISBN: 0130814385.

